// ============================================================================
// Shared visualization utilities, ports of four ringdater R helpers:
//   x.scale.bar   -> xScaleBar    (R/x_scale_bar_function.R)
//   y.scale.bar   -> yScaleBar    (R/y_scale_bar_function.R)
//   col_pal       -> colPal       (R/col_pal_function.R)
